My addition for the wand of everything puts an interesting
twist on this.  A wand of everything (zaps as a random wand each time)
is already polymorphous, so it isn't affected by a wand of polymorph.
This introduces entropy; wands that turn into wands of everything
stop changing.  This would reduce but not eliminate polypiling
(you can hold polymorph wands out and use scrolls of charging on them).

